Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Replay infer_action from one CUDA graph

GraphedActionInfer captures FastWAM.infer_action at a fixed serving shape
into one CUDA graph; its action chunks are bitwise equal to infer_action's.
Opt-in: the default inference path is unchanged.
